	quest.7D2A677786DC83F6.title: "红色警报"
	quest.7D319BB781227B4F.quest_desc: ["The §6Electrolytic Separator§r splits water into §bhydrogen§r and §boxygen§r gas, the starting point for Mekanism's chemistry and higher ore processing."]
